{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12396","headline":"柏崖老人号无名先生男削发女黄冠自以云泉独乐命予赋诗 · 钱起","name":"柏崖老人号无名先生男削发女黄冠自以云泉独乐命予赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古也忧婚嫁，君能乐性肠。\n长男栖月宇，少女炫霓裳。\n问尔餐霞处，春山芝桂旁。\n鹤前飞九转，壶里驻三光。\n与我开龙峤，披云静药堂。\n胡麻兼藻绿，石髓隔花香。\n帝力言何有，椿年喜渐长。\n窅然高象外，宁不傲羲皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}